window.products.push({"id":921042,"name":"Roll Top Bread Box Slimline (Walnut)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vo-i-7JPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Roll top Bread Box is one of the most practical and popular kitchen items available! It's not just a bread box; it's a once-in-a-lifetime investment you won't find in a department store anywhere! This is a unique and useful storage item for the kitchen or even in a dining area. This Roll Top Bread Box makes a great hidden storage location in your kitchen! This is also a great gift for a wedding shower, or Christmas. Our Roll-Top Bread Box is made with a Custom produced Half Round Solid Walnut Tambour front, backed with a Marine grade Vinyl. A real furniture quality piece of woodworking for your wonderful fresh baked breads! We Custom make all our Tambour fronts right here in our shop. Approximate size: 16 x 12 x 11 H (inches) This Roll Top Bread Box made of solid Walnut. This wooden oak bread box is great because it is large enough to hold a loaf of bread, hamburger buns, chips and other items all at the same time, yet sets under your cabinet in a fairly small space. The ease of using the roll top pleases our customers, and just reflects the quality of our \"Made in Missouri\" craftsmanship. With the classic styling of an antique roll-top desk, this handsome walnut bread box will be an appealing addition to almost any kitchen decor. Our walnut bread box is expertly crafted of solid red oak, and this beautiful bread box enhances any counter top. Since the kitchen and dining area are a central gathering place in any home, you will find many uses for this beautiful solid construction bread box. You can use it for bread, or even store your mail and other items that often clutter your counter top. This is a high quality walnut bread box and is very attractive. Your bread box will be a handcrafted furniture heirloom that your family will keep for years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vo-i-7JPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Family Woodworking","source_asin":"B00P6VD4NS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P6VD4NS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P6VD4NS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
