window.products.push({"id":921121,"name":"Flypigs 360degree Rotating Colorful LED Light Magnetic Levitation Shoe Display Stand Floating Sneaker Stand Suspension Night Lamp Levitating Shoe Rack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X7DGqLl0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The magnetic levitation shoe display stand comes with LED color light to make your shoes more shining and cool, which will leaving a deep impression on consumers.  Feature: ★ It combines a quality build with an aesthetic look to shine your sneakers, basketball shoe, high heels, hiking shoes, etc in mid-air. ★ The floating display stand uses the power of electromagnetism to suspend any sneaker, shoes of your choosing in mid-air. ★ The electromagnetic currents coupled with a built-in fan are used to levitate and rotate the sneaker in mid-air! ★ When the object is accidentally hit and deviates from the suspension track, it will stop suspending and adsorb on the display rack. Automatic protection when power off, it will be adsorbed on the display rack and will not fall.  Specification: Light: Color LED lights Size: 44CM/17.32\"x23.5CM/9.25\"x7CM/2.76\" Load-bearing: 350-700g Levitation Gap:13-20mm Balls: 50g*3 Application: Conference rooms, exhibitions, home furnishings, shopping malls, shop facades, exhibition halls, office, home Package Includes: 1 x Stand 1 x Power Cable 1 x Magnet 3 x Balls 1 x Manual 1 x Remote Control  How To Use: 1.Put the magnet into the top of shoes.  2.Place one hand hold the magnet inside the shoes, place another side of shoe with your another hand. Position the shoe about 15mm below the frame. This is the floating distance. 3.When the shoe is in the proper position, you will feel a strong force holding the shoe. The release the shoe gently. The shoes is floating.  Note: 1. If it can't automatically rotate 360 degrees at the beginning, please give it a thrust to achieve continuous rotation. 2. If there is a small dent on the magnet, it will not affect the use.3.Please allow 1-2cm differences due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X7DGqLl0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flypigs","source_asin":"B0948X8S2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0948X8S2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0948X8S2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
