window.products.push({"id":921316,"name":"Modus Furniture Cally Solid Wood Chest of Drawers, Antique Mocha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KXclrA78L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cally Solid Wood Chest of Drawers is crafted entirely from solid pine for the classic farmhouse look. Sanded and stained solid wood drawer boxes feature English dovetail joinery for maximum rigidity and lasting quality; dust cover under bottom drawer; felt lined top drawer. Full extension, ball bearing drawer slides for smooth, efficient operation and ample weight capacity. Trimmed with heavy round knobs in a distressed bronze finish. Wood is kiln dried for added strength. Please keep in mind that natural wood must breathe and is affected by environmental conditions. Expect to see shrinkage or expansion and plank movement over time. These normal occurrences will not affect the structural integrity of the piece. With proper care, this solid wood furniture will last for generations. Frame, top, side, front and drawer boxes are solid pine; drawer bottoms are hardwood plywood; back panel and dust covers are hardwood plywood. Covered by a 1-year manufacturer's warranty. Product Dimensions: 18-Inch by 38-Inch by 56-Inch. Weighs 172-pounds. With graceful curves, modern sensibility and functional appeal, the Cally bedroom provides an updated take on classic farmhouse style. Crafted entirely from solid pine, rough-hewn planks bear the characteristic saw marks, dents, pits and random knots of freshly-milled timber. Antique Mocha finish uses a rustic glaze to simulate the patina of weathered lumber and a lacquer top coat to showcase the rich natural character of the wood. An obvious fit for any country or lodge setting, Cally should also be considered as part of Southwest, or Mediterranean décors, where its oil rubbed bronze knobs complement bold vibrant colors and rigid materials like stucco, tile and stone. Construction features also work well with styles that recognize attention to detail and pride of workmanship, such as Mission, Craftsman or Ranch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KXclrA78L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B00LF34G9C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LF34G9C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LF34G9C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
