window.products.push({"id":921405,"name":"Circle of Drink - Simone Chrome Plated Stainless Yerba Mate Bombilla (Filtered Straw - Round Shaft) - 7.9 in / 20 cm - with Microfiber Cleaning Cloth ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I+Y8-3QnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautifully crafted chrome plated stainless bombilla with 220+ filter count for seamless sipping of fine to coarse herbs. Round shaft and tapered spout for easy sipping. Perfect size: 7.9 in / 20 cm. Includes microfiber cleaning cloth carry case. Enjoy yerba mate tea and any herbs you desire with this easy-to-use filtered tea straw. Made in Brazil. Fair Wages Paid. Enjoy and salud! Cleaning your yerba mate bombilla Rinse with warm soapy water then dry with microfiber cleaning cloth to restore luster and shine. For a deep cleansing, boil in water for 5 minutes. What is yerba mate tea? Yerba Mate (pronounced YER-bah MAH-tay) is a type of holly plant native to Paraguay, Argentina, and Brazil. Drunk for thousands of years by the native Guaraní tribe of the Paraná, the plant has been revered for its ability to naturally stimulate the mind and body. How to prepare yerba mate tea with your gourd and bombilla? 1. Fill gourd with 3/4s yerba mate tea.  2. Push yerba mate to one side of the gourd with a spoon on your bombilla, creating a mountain of mate on one side.  3. Add room temperature or cold water to this open space and allow to sit for 30 seconds.  4. Insert your bombilla to the side you poured the water, then begin sipping.  5. Proceed with adding hot (not exceeding 165ºF) or cold water and enjoy until the mate becomes tasteless. Yerba Mate Health Benefits Increases wellbeing and Happiness  Natural Energizer  Loaded with Antioxidants  Decreases Stress  Improves Sleep  Lowers Blood Pressure  Lowers Bad Cholesterol  Help you Lose Weight  Boosts Creativity  Improves Immune System","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I+Y8-3QnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circle of Drink","source_asin":"B084Q2T4JX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084Q2T4JX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084Q2T4JX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
