window.products.push({"id":921413,"name":"Silicone Spatula Scraper and Butter Cake Cream Spreader Combo | Safest Materials: No Plastics, BPA Free | Non-Stick Materials and Easy Clean Dishwashe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ylI2veRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to the Next Level of Kitchen Utensils .  Food Grade Silicone has been shown to be much safer than traditional plastics, which may leach micro particles into the food.  That’s why this combo set is made from 100% Food Grade Silicone .  The product contains a Solid Metal Core to offer structure when needing pressure and 100% Food Grade Silicone Exterior for a comfortable flexible scooping action.  You get Both the Spatula Scraper and Spreader Butter Knife in One Value-Packed Set. TOP FEATURES HEAT RESISTANT, NO MELTING This product is made from 100% Food Grade Silicone, and is heat resistant up to 600 Degrees Fahrenheit.  This means No Melting like other plastic based products. 100% FOOD GRADE SILICONE This product is made from 100% Food Grade Silicone.  Silicone has been shown in many recent studies to be much safer than plastic products, which may leach micro toxic material into the food.  This is why the food industry is moving away from plastics and toward safer materials such as silicone. EASY CLEANING, DISHWASHER SAFE Food Grade Silicone is a Breeze to clean.  Simply toss it into the dishwasher and you’re good to go.  It’s 100% Dishwasher Safe! GREAT BALANCE OF FLEX AND STIFFNESS With a solid metal core and food grade silicone exterior, this product has a great balance of flexibility to scoop up bowl contents yet still have the stiffness to bear pressure when needed. INCLUDED IN SET This super value pack includes One (x1) Silicone Spatula Scraper and One (x1) Silicone Spreader Butter Knife.  Both in Color Green.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ylI2veRmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Delight","source_asin":"B08Q39BSZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q39BSZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q39BSZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":921414,"name":"Sabatier Laguiole 6-Piece Steak Knife Set, Black and Brass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DZ41Q67YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com The Laguiole knife originated in 1829 in a French mountain village of the same name. Back then, farmers folded it into their pocket. Today, Laguiole steak knives are made in Thiers, the French cutlery center, according to the original design--except they don't fold. Long (9-1/8 inches overall, with 4-1/2-inch blades) and slender, these knives impart a whiff of ornate chateau manners and crystal chandeliers. Bonelike handles are elongated \"pistol grips\" like those on dueling weapons. Five tiny brass rivets bind them to full tangs. Brass caps decorate handle ends. Tiny steel bees sit atop brass bolsters, homage to a bee on Napoleon's Imperial emblem, awarded to him for bravery. Blades are finely serrated. Wash these knives by hand with mild detergent and store them in their wood case. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DZ41Q67YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sabatier","source_asin":"B00004SCQY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SCQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SCQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
