window.products.push({"id":921557,"name":"A5 Wooden Blank Recipe Book to Write in (7.5 x 6 inch) - Cook Book with 80 Sheets for Handwritten Recipes - Hardcover Family Kitchen Journal and Recip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DL8Tf5rOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You spend a lot of time in the kitchen, love to cook, constantly come up with new recipes and ideas, but you have nowhere to write them down? Use an empty handmade wood recipe book. Collect all your notes in a colorful notebook! Let it be your own recipe diary book. Use it for family recipes, notes and like kitchen journal. You can also use it at any discretion, such as writing journals, sketchbook, guest book, wish book, recipe books or planner. This recipe book is blank and waiting for your cooking set. 80 sheets allows you to record recipes for the most complex dishes, from salads to desserts. Eco notebook with plywood cover allows the recipe scrapbook to be collapsible and convinient for handwriting recipe cards. 4-Ring binder in hardcover cookbook prevent recipes from tearing and provide convenient page turning. For each recipe or meals ready to cook you can use sheet with an indication of the complexity of cooking, cook time, cost of the dish, ingredients, directions and other notes. Create personalized recipe cards and draw each sheet as you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DL8Tf5rOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOXTEED","source_asin":"B08HVN365Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HVN365Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HVN365Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
