window.products.push({"id":921583,"name":"Self Adhesive Vinyl Black Floral Shelf Drawer Liner Contact Paper for Cabinets Dresser Furniture Wall Decor Sticker 17.7x117 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ayRMX3awL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"This decorative floral contact paper shelf drawer liner is a quick and economical solution to modernize furniture accessories and appliances in your home.  PLEASE NOTED: If you purchase two items or more, we will package all items together in ONE continuous roll. Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.  Instruction For Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, drawer, dresser ,cabinet,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth. 5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.   Note: 1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only. 2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference. 3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface. Hope you can understand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ayRMX3awL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLOW4U","source_asin":"B077WTCL71","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077WTCL71","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077WTCL71","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
