window.products.push({"id":921631,"name":"Witchcraft Supplies Kit Box Witch Tools - 15 Pack Crystals Dried Herbs 15 Pack Colored Magic Candles for Meditation Divination - Suitable for Beginner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9178SCXMzSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Witchcraft Kit All-in-one】: Our magic wishing kit contains a variety of witchcraft supplies, which are necessary for a witch experiencer and beginner to make magic happen. With it you can easily master the basics for witches spellwork, altar, pagan rituals and wiccan practices. At the same time it is also an upgraded travel witch kit. 【15 Sets of Dried Flowers】: We provide a wide variety of herbs for pagan and witchcraft rituals, magic, arts and handicrafts, etc. They are natural products without any chemical processing. Rosemary, Lemongrass, Sage, St. John's wort, Catnip, Red rose petals buds, Hibiscus flower, Lavender, Peppermint, Motherwort, Hyssop, Yarrow, Alfalfa, Nettle leaf, Eucalyptus leaf. 【15 Mini Crystal Jars】:We have selected 15 different mini natural crystal stones for witchcraft lovers: Obsidian, Tiger eye, Red Agate, Garnet, Peridot, Lapis Lazuli, Prehnite, Labradorite, Moonstone, Aventurine , Amethyst, Rock crystal, Blue Apatite, Amazonite, Gold Rutilated. They are suitable for witchcraft, wicca healing, reiki energy, grids, meditation, chakra work, reiki healing, yoga, spells and wiccan decor or witchcraft decor. 【12 Colors 15 Pack Candles】: Candles are indispensable in the process of casting magic. Different colored candles represent different wishes. So we have prepared candles in the 12 most common colors for witchcraft lovers: 2 white, 3 black, purple, pink, blue, yellow, light green, dark green, brown, orange, red, beige. 【Exquisite Gift Box】： Each product is individually packaged. For beginners and enthusiasts, it is a witchcraft tool box that can be carried around. We are committed to establishing a better link between human spirit and magic, helping to purify human spirit and releasing your stress. At the same time, it is also a good birthday, Christmas, Halloween, and holiday gift for friends and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9178SCXMzSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOOMUU","source_asin":"B097XQFMFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921631","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097XQFMFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097XQFMFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":921632,"name":"IZUS Bag-Organizer-Rack-Holder Purse Hanger for Door - 20 Hooks for Handbags for Closet and Door 2Pcs (Rack for Handbags/2 pcs Hold 20 Bags)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zK1s2G6rL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","description":"Over-the-door hooks fit both residential (1.35\") and commercial (1.55\") thick doors.Suitable for most doors. If your door or closet-door is too narrow ,you can put foam pad or cardboard to fill the space ，(our product 1set = 2pcs products inclue 4pcs door hooks and 2pcs nylon tapes（Finished product display ) with1pcs plastic buckle to adjustable the nylon tape length & 20pcs plastic buckles to lock hooks anti-slip & 20pcs hooks to holder bags, hats, tie, ect) NOT INCLUDE THE FOAM PADS OR CARDBOARD . Multifuncional Organizer: Not only Organize handbag,purses, back-packs,also work as hat rack, coat rack.Find your belts, bags and hats where they belong and enjoy your new closet organizer system.You can adjust the distance between the hooks by referring to the size of the bags or the hats ect . The plastic buckle can be opened to adjust the distance, and then locked to prevent slipping. What a Concept to Space Saving : Clutter-free closet,Use the handbag holder when needed it is the perfect closet organizer hanging for your purse. The hanging closet organizer takes up little space and can be left on the door without taking up too much space or remove it as needed. Organize All Your Stuffs: Very neatly,no more messy in your room anymore. Anti-Slip and Plastic Buckle to Locked each Hook : High qulity nylon strap and ad-justable buckle ensures no more slip ofyour stuffs.We have tested, It bear 8 lb each hook, please rest assured to use, our products are very safe and durable! (Remind : The Buckles need to pull on to lock.the nylon-tape is long than door,our suggestion is to keep it, so that it can be used on other doors of different heights,if you still think the tape is too long for your needs ,you can cut off the excess tape) Installation Instructions: The 1st Step: Fix tight the up door-hooks with foam fixing pads against the door , if your door too narrow ( pad to both inner front and back of the door hook), make sure there is no gap between the hook and the door. The 2nd Step: Hook the strap on the up door hook. The 3rd Step: Fix the down door hook.The 4th Step: Adjust length of the strap to the tightest length and locked on the nylon tape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zK1s2G6rL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IZUS","source_asin":"B07XYMRF9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XYMRF9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XYMRF9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
