window.products.push({"id":921727,"name":"Blue Funeral Urn by Liliane Memorials - Cremation Urn for Human Ashes - Hand Made in Brass - Suitable for Cemetery Burial or Niche - Large Size fits r","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ir9N-PyCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liliane Memorials Aluminum Cremation Urns Ambleu Model Funeral urn is handcrafted with a hand enameled finish.  Perfect for honoring and remembering a loved one.  Urn will fit well with any decor, particularly on a mantel over a fireplace or in a library. Perfectly sized to fit in columbarium or niche.  The Ambleu urn evokes the memory of your loved one in a traditional and light-weight design. About Liliane Memorial Urns Our handcrafting process results in slight variations in color or finish, making each urn a unique work of art.  Our urns offer a threaded enclosure that allows you to safely and securely handle or transport the urn.  Liliane urns are maintenance free; simply wipe the hand-made aluminum urn with a clean dry cloth.  All of our urns are wrapped in a plush bag and securely packed in a cardboard box.  Capacity: 190 cubic inches; fits the remains of adults weighing up to 190 lbs. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee We trust that you will be happy with the quality and design of our products  If you are not happy with the design you selected, please return your unused urn to Amazon for a full credit and select another Liliane Memorial Urn.  Unfortunately, given the personal nature of funeral urns we cannot accept returns after you have used the urn.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ir9N-PyCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liliane Memorials","source_asin":"B01M4GON2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M4GON2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M4GON2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":921728,"name":"Quadro Frames 6x24 inch Picture Frame, Black, Style P375-3/8 inch Wide Molding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617VWJclgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All our picture frames are produced on demand at our facility in Spencer MA using our exclusive Quadro Frames molding system. Moldings are custom extruded to our specifications and consist of ABS plastic with a metallized mylar finish, they are virtually indistinguishable from a metal frame at a fraction of the cost. Backing panels are 0.10 inch thick MDF (Medium Density Fiberboard) - NOT cheap corrugated cardboard. Front panels are 0.040\" thick optically clear PET plastic with an opaque and/or blue protective peel away film applied to both sides. While assembling your frames make sure to peel off the protective film from BOTH sides of the plastic panel. The frames dimensions refer to the PANELS so that media of the specified size will fit in the frame. The external dimensions of the frame are 3/8 inch larger than nominal size. The visible image size (accounting for the overlap of the moldings over the panels) is 3/4 inch less than the nominal size. The moldings are side loading and in additional to the panels provided will accomodate 3/16 inches of media thickness. This is sufficient space for an image as well as a double standard thickness matteboard. All components are manufactured to the highest tolerances for a picture frame of seamless fit and finish. Assembly is required but consists simply of snapping four (4) corner connectors onto the moldings, no tools are required the frames literally snap together in seconds. The corner connectors fit onto the back side of the moldings and are not visible from the front or sides. The frames are designed to hang from the corner connectors, which include an arc shaped sawtooth pattern for fine levelling adjustment on the spot! These classic contemporary style picture frames are an excellent choice for framing virtually any image with a professional gallery look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617VWJclgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Quadro Frames","source_asin":"B00XIIOB24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XIIOB24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XIIOB24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
