window.products.push({"id":921738,"name":"Segretto Cookware 3.6 QT Braiser Enameled Cast Iron Casserole Pan With Cover, Grigio Scuro (Gradient Gray) Cast Iron Braiser Pan With Lid, Lasagna Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vmziHktkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"JACK-OF-ALL-TRADES OF COOKWARES. Unlike an enameled cast iron skillet and dutch oven pot with lid, this cast iron braiser pan with lid has a lot more functionality than them. It’s a cross-over between a dutch oven and a skillet that’s great for searing, simmering, roasting, and braising. PROTECTED BY ENAMEL COATING. The Segretto Cookware enameled cast iron braiser has three layers of enamel coating that protect the braising pan from rust and other unwanted things. SUPERIOR HEAT DISTRIBUTION AND RETENTION. Cooking without worrying is one of the best features of braiser pans. It has a dome-shaped lid that circulates steam to lock in moisture and flavor. JACK-OF-ALL-TRADES OF COOKWARES. Unlike an enameled cast iron skillet and dutch oven pot with lid, this cast iron braiser pan with lid has a lot more functionality than them. It’s a cross-over between a dutch oven and a skillet that’s great for searing, simmering, roasting, and braising. EASY TO CLEAN AND HANDLE. Cleaning wouldn’t be a problem with this ceramic enameled cast iron braiser pan because you can easily hand wash it with warm water and liquid detergent. COMPATIBLE WITH ALL COOKTOPS. This all-around cast iron casserole dish enamel cookware is compatible with any cooktop, even induction. You can use it on gas, electric, induction, and oven. OVEN-SAFE. This braiser pan with lid is oven and heat safe and can withstand temperatures up to 500°F. PRETTY AND FUNCTIONAL. Collect all five colors of the Segretto Cookware covered braiser. Get it in red, black, gray, white, and green, and they are not just pretty but also double as an excellent serving dish. ERGONOMIC HANDLES. This enamel coated cast iron cookware has two large and sturdy handles on the side for convenience. You can carry the pot without worrying about the heat burning your hands. VERSATILE COOKWARE. There is no other enamel cookware like the braising pan with lid that you can use for many cooking styles like roasting chicken, toasting sandwiches, cooking meatballs, home fries, apple fritters, and braising meats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vmziHktkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Segretto Cookware","source_asin":"B0B1CDCXPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921738","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1CDCXPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1CDCXPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
