window.products.push({"id":921972,"name":"Molblly King Size Mattress, 14 inch Cooling-Gel Memory Foam Mattress in a Box, Breathable Bed Mattress for Cooler Sleep Supportive & Pressure Relief， ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713Dl1AN8DL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"{MATERIAL & CONSTRUCTION}: To improve support and heat dissipation, Molblly 14 inch Cooling-Gel Memory Foam Mattress is designed with FOUR layers all-foam system, including 2.5\" gel memory foam, 2.5\" of comfortable layer, 2\" soft pressure relief foam and 7\" high density base support foam for ultimate comfort. {HEALTH & HYPOALLERGENIC MATTRESS}: The foam has been certified by CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex Standard 103 without harmful substances like formaldehyde, mercury, and other heavy metals. {COMFORTABLE & BREATHABLE}: All-foam bed design combined expertise and the best materials with advanced sleep technology. Memory foam conducive to continuous airflow & breathable; skin-friendly fabrics adapt to the environment to keep the mattress surface at the ideal sleeping temperature; Buoyant, no-sink support foams adapt and conform to your body for optimal pressure relief; Specialized foams reduce motion transfer of a partner so your sleep is undisturbed. {EASY SHIPPING & SET-UP}: Mattress is compressed and packaged in a box for shipping, allowing it to easily be delivered to your door and expand to its full lofty shape inside your home. They fit all frames, such as box spring, floor, slatted base, flat platform or adjustable bed, hospital bed. {WARRANTY}: We are a manufacturer specializing in the production and processing of mattresses, We also have professional production and R&D teams. guarantee the best price mattress you can get. Our bed mattress comes with 10 years warranty. If for any reason you are unsatisfied, contact us at any time for support. NOTE: Please allow up to 72 hours after opening the mattress for any potential odor to dissipate and adjust to its final feel once the foam settles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713Dl1AN8DL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molblly","source_asin":"B07XKFVF2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-921972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XKFVF2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XKFVF2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
